Swedish clan founded in [[2022]] with former members of [[Oblivion]], [[Lege Artis]], [[Tribe of Tjernobyl]], [[Chosen]] and [[Hellfire]].

In the first year of existence '''tSQ''' played {{team|The Axemen|flag=no}} a whopping 130 times with 66 wins and 64 losses. They bested them in the division 2 Grand Final of [[Qlan War Tournament 2]] in a thrilling 3 - 2 victory for the Gold.

